you improve your skill and experience,\ncome to this tower again, and\nI'll open this door for you.\n","1000010":"We're waiting for a stronger man to pass through.\nComplete more missions and come back again!\n","1000011":"Holly Spirit of life!\nHeal this evil wound!\n","1000012":"I will heal any wound.\n","1000013":"Hang in there.\n","1000014":"I've got good things.\n \n \u30fb~Trade Items           ~\n \u30fb~Identify Items        ~\n \u30fb~Repair Items          ~\n                       ~QUIT~\n","1000015":" \u30fb~Arms               %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Head Armor         %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Body Armor         %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Shield             %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Leg Armor          %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~All Equipped Items %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Non-Equipped Items %9d Gold~\n                           ~QUIT~\n","1000016":"Not enough money.\n","1000017":"Already fixed.\n","1000018":"I need %d in gold to identify your item. OK?\n \n                 ~YES~  ~NO~\n","1000019":"All identified.\n"},"status":[[0,7,4294967295,0],[0,3,10000000,2],[0,3,10000001,3],[0,5,4294967295,4],[0,0,10000300,5],[0,0,10000301,6],[0,0,10000900,7],[0,5,4294967295,8],[0,0,10000200,15],[0,0,12000000,16],[0,1,12000000,22],[0,0,12000001,29],[0,1,12000001,30],[0,0,12000002,84],[0,1,12000002,93]],"blocks":[[[6,[[1,0],[1,8]]],[49,[[2,1000000]]],[50,[[4,1000004]]],[0,[[4,1000004],[0,0],[1,50],[0,1]]]],[[16,[[4,1000073],[1,0],[6,10000200],[7,10000200]]]],[[17,[[1,99000012],[1,1]]]],[],[[56,[[1,10011000],[1,1],[1,1],[1,1]]],[56,[[1,10011001],[1,0],[1,0],[1,0]]],[56,[[1,10011002],[1,0],[1,0],[1,0]]]],[[41,[[0,0]]]],[[41,[[0,0]]]],[[41,[[1,1]]]],[[34,[[1,10000202],[4,1000004]]],[0,[[4,1000004],[0,0],[1,0],[0,9]]],[0,[[4,1000004],[0,2],[1,0],[0,14]]]],[[0,[[10,24],[0,0],[1,0],[0,10]]],[0,[[1,1245680],[0,1],[1,1000],[0,11]]],[0,[[4,1000020],[0,0],[1,0],[0,12]]],[27,[[1,10000200],[1,0],[1,-48],[2,1000001],[1,224],[1,224],[1,224],[0,1000]]],[1,[[4,1000005],[4,1000019]]],[15,[[4,1000005],[1,60]]],[0,[[4,1000005